/v1/","context":{"app_id":4556830,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4556830-1846651706691399","game_id":"steam-4556830","kind":"announcement","title":"Next Fest, and somebody in your park is taking notes","summary":"Hi fellow managers!We're taking part in Steam Next Fest from October 19 to 26, and we've updated the demo for it. If you've been waiting for a reason to come back to the park, this is a good one.Say hello to TroublemakersSome of the people wandering your park aren't there for the monsters. A Troublemaker quietly collects Suspicious Evidence while nobody's looking, and if they gather enough of it, it ends up in the newspaper. Which, given what we are all actually running here, is not ideal.So now","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691399","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:51:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4556830-1845383656389473","game_id":"steam-4556830","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #3: Discussing Demos","summary":"Hi fellow managers! A month has passed since we launched Monster Park Tycoon's demo! Yay! We were looking forward to being able to share with you some of the stuff we had been cooking for months, and we are very happy with the results. Demo LaunchInitially we planned the demo for a later date, with a bit more of content. We wanted to test quite a few things and see what really stuck with you and what could be improved on. However, mid development we received the fantastic news that Monster Park ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-03T16:00:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656389473","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:51:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4556830-1842846814446748","game_id":"steam-4556830","kind":"update","title":"New Demo Update!","summary":"Hi fellow managers!We have been working super hard on fixing a lot of bugs and issues, as well as implementing some nice Quality of Life features some of you have proposed! Feel free to join our Discord to take part in the community's live discussions!In the process we have encountered a massive bug behind the scenes. The kind of scary bug that makes us consider including in the game as a monster... but we managed to exterminate it before it caused more problems! This fierce fight has left some ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-04T14:23:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814446748","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:51:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4556830-1842212951297230","game_id":"steam-4556830","kind":"announcement","title":"We're at Gamescom, and our demo just dropped on Steam!","summary":"\"ATTENTION ALL STAFF. Management has approved a corporate outing. Selected personnel have traveled to a convention facility in Cologne, Germany, to demonstrate our operations to members of the public. While there, staff will refrain from mentioning the cult Staff Enrichment Programme, the sacrifices, voluntary career transitions, and the hole Employee Relocation Chute. Smile. Praise the Dark Lord CEO.\"Thank you, Management. Hi, everyone!A couple of weeks ago we teased you that you would soon be ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-26T15:03:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951297230","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:51:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4556830-1842212951297229","game_id":"steam-4556830","kind":"announcement","title":"Monster Park Tycoon demo is here!","summary":"“Attention all cultists workers, one of our parks will be open to the public before time. This is not a drill, I repeat, this is not a drill. Please head to your workplaces as soon as possible. Remember to smile and wave at every visitor. Attend to all their needs and make them have fun and safe so that they never want to leave the park. Cross your fingers so everything goes as planned! PRAISE THE DARK LORD CEO!” Hi fellow managers! We are so happy to finally release Monster Park Tycoon’s demo! ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-26T15:03:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951297229","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:51:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4556830-1840310314351974","game_id":"steam-4556830","kind":"announcement","title":"New name, same cult!","summary":"Hi fellow managers! \"ATTENTION ALL STAFF. Following a routine review by Management, this facility will no longer be referred to as a ZOO. Effective immediately, we are a PARK. Please update your paperwork, your uniforms and your prayers accordingly. Anyone caught using the old name will be sacrificed gently reminded.\" Ok, that's enough out of Management. Hi, everyone! Yes, we have some news: we have a new name. Monster Zoo Tycoon is now Monster Park TycoonSame game, same team, same Dark Lord. Ju","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-10T16:30:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314351974","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:51:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4556830-1839676055885725","game_id":"steam-4556830","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #2: Our Challenges!","summary":"Hi fellow managers! First of all, I want to celebrate with y’all that Spain is the football World Champion! As almost any Spaniard, we are super happy about this, and it feels extra special because we launched a football game this past June, so it has felt super cool to follow our national team to the victory while working on Early Access content for that game! This is for sure something we will remember forever. Challenges!Ok, so this championship has given me the idea to write about CHALLENGES","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-30T16:00:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055885725","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:51:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4556830-1836506165554469","game_id":"steam-4556830","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #1: Meet the team, learn about the project!","summary":"Hi fellow managers! We have been super busy this past month, as preparing everything to announce this game took a lot of work, and launching another game in the mean time didn’t help! Now that things are more chill for us, I wanted to spend some time writing our first devlog to introduce ourselves.So, who are we?We are OverPowered Team, a small Spanish indie studio made up of 5 friends who met more than a decade ago in university. We have been working together pretty much since our first year th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-26T16:00:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165554469","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:51:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4556830-1836506165548854","game_id":"steam-4556830","kind":"announcement","title":"The Steam Summer Sale Is On Now!","summary":"The Steam Summer Sale is on now, running June 25 to July 9! Don't forget to wishlist Monster Zoo Tycoon now. While you wait, check out great deals on other indie.io titles during the Summer Sale to add to your collection. https://store.steampowered.com/app/4556830/","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-25T10:53:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165548854","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:51:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4556830-1834602721197102","game_id":"steam-4556830","kind":"announcement","title":"Welcome to our completely normal zoo!","summary":"“At last, the day has finally come! Management has given me permission to contact all of you regarding the new job positions as Zoo Managers. Prepare yourself to be the leader of the most successful CULT! Er… wait, remove that… Prepare yourself to be the leader of the most successful ZOO!Summon all sorts of creatures, from zombies to werewolves and vampires! Make them the main attraction to LURE as many visitors into the park. Entertain them, let them have the times of their lives and be sure to","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-07T21:17:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721197102","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:51:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4556830":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:54:16Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T02:54:15Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4556830":"2026-10-26T02:54:16Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4556830":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:54:15Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:54:15Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[